{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415801","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415801","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041580101:0":{"text":"瑞恩小姐！我名为格温妮丝，是皇家守备军的一员。","source_cn":"瑞恩小姐！我名为格温妮丝，是皇家守备军的一员。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4337292FC24D12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580102:0":{"text":"久闻你在对班题斯的战役中立下赫赫战功，我一直期盼着能与你见上一面！","source_cn":"久闻你在对班题斯的战役中立下赫赫战功，我一直期盼着能与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC310092D72A465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580103:0":{"text":"格温妮丝……你就是狩龙骑士？为什么想要见我？","source_cn":"格温妮丝……你就是狩龙骑士？为什么想要见我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7217862B24794FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580104:0":{"text":"不，等等，难道是因为我接任家主后，从未去赛凡纳觐见过国王与王后陛下……","source_cn":"不，等等，难道是因为我接任家主后，从未去赛凡纳觐见过国...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE873CFE5337FF041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580105:0":{"text":"万分抱歉！先前战事紧张，我一直未有机会抽身。","source_cn":"万分抱歉！先前战事紧张，我一直未有机会抽身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB0BE8034B7961B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580106:0":{"text":"你误会了，瑞恩小姐。同为骑士，我只是想向你表示由衷的敬佩。","source_cn":"你误会了，瑞恩小姐。同为骑士，我只是想向你表示由衷的敬佩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41AB32710992215E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580107:0":{"text":"为何？我没做过什么特别的事，只是履行家主之责而已。","source_cn":"为何？我没做过什么特别的事，只是履行家主之责而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x138986BA1C9B837A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580108:0":{"text":"还有，叫我爱丝就好，我们年纪相仿，不必如此尊敬。","source_cn":"还有，叫我爱丝就好，我们年纪相仿，不必如此尊敬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE8D45EA36C29FF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580109:0":{"text":"爱丝特瑞达……咳，爱丝小姐，你的实力担得起这样的赞誉。","source_cn":"爱丝特瑞达……咳，爱丝小姐，你的实力担得起这样的赞誉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9013EFEC806A5191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580110:0":{"text":"父亲曾说过，正因有你们瑞恩家族驻守灰影郡，皇都才能一直维持着和平的生活。","source_cn":"父亲曾说过，正因有你们瑞恩家族驻守灰影郡，皇都才能一直...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E462B17FE32C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580111:0":{"text":"那是我的祖先世代积累的基业。我很清楚，我与父亲、叔叔和堂哥，都还差得远。","source_cn":"那是我的祖先世代积累的基业。我很清楚，我与父亲、叔叔和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9779D71D34DB2A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580112:0":{"text":"我只希望在与他们重聚的那天，能够自豪地对他们说出：我不负瑞恩之名。","source_cn":"我只希望在与他们重聚的那天，能够自豪地对他们说出：我不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33ACE97CDDF7D200","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580113:0":{"text":"爱丝小姐……原来，你也会有自我怀疑的时候吗？","source_cn":"爱丝小姐……原来，你也会有自我怀疑的时候吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B0259CA2C079BFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580114:0":{"text":"当然会。但我没有多少时间去想那些，毕竟战事不等人。","source_cn":"当然会。但我没有多少时间去想那些，毕竟战事不等人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x311F9B4F283D16D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580115:0":{"text":"嗯。或许就是因为我在此事上耗费了太多时间，才会……","source_cn":"嗯。或许就是因为我在此事上耗费了太多时间，才会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F559066E75FBF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041580116:0":{"text":"呃……抱歉，格温妮丝小姐，是我把聊天气氛带偏了。","source_cn":"呃……抱歉，格温妮丝小姐，是我把聊天气氛带偏了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D4279B74DD227E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041580117:1":{"text":"多谢你的提醒。现在形势暂缓，我确实应该着手安排赛凡纳的行程了。","source_cn":"多谢你的提醒。现在形势暂缓，我确实应该着手安排赛凡纳的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B4E06152B5BA54D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041580118:0":{"text":"请让我来当你的向导吧，爱丝小姐。如果可以的话，请务必多停留几日。","source_cn":"请让我来当你的向导吧，爱丝小姐。如果可以的话，请务必多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE0D97E1299CDF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041580119:0":{"text":"多停留几日？为什么?国王陛下的日程安排很紧凑吗？","source_cn":"多停留几日？为什么?国王陛下的日程安排很紧凑吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA3717D6D870BD0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041580120:1":{"text":"并非如此，只是……城内有几家餐厅的下午茶颇为出色，我很想邀你去品尝。","source_cn":"并非如此，只是……城内有几家餐厅的下午茶颇为出色，我很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB0E5F86E8546EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041580121:0":{"text":"还有秘银商会的摊位！那里经常会售卖许多可爱——我是说，精美的玩偶。","source_cn":"还有秘银商会的摊位！那里经常会售卖许多可爱——我是说，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F60CB9FB66873A5","varia